  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 209.01 Definitions.\n\n(a) “Person” means “person” as defined in RSA 146-A:11-b, I(a).\n\n(b) “Penalties” means penalties assessed by the department of safety under RSA 146-A:11-b, IV.\n\nSource. #8490-B, eff 11-22-05; ss by #9918-B, eff 4-28-11; ss by #10580, eff 4-30-14; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
